WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: After the Show (1-10)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Neon Hearts (1989)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.600
[Percussive Acoustic Guitar Intro]

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.000
The stage is empty, the crowd is gone

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Another night, another dawn

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.500
We played the part, we sang the song

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:47.500
And now we have to move along

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.500
The neon heart is turning low

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.500
It's just a faded, distant glow

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:05.200
Is this the dream we wanted so?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.500
I guess we'll never know

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.200
We're just echoes in the city

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:21.500
It's not so bad, it's not so pretty

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.800
Just echoes, turning to gray

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.500
We'll come back and fight another day

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:55.800
[Soft Melodic Acoustic Guitar Solo]

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Another day...

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Another way...

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:14.000
[Acoustic Guitar Interlude]

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:19.000
Just echoes, turning to gray

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:25.000
We'll come back and fight another day

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:32.200
[Acoustic Guitar Break]

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.000
After the show...

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.000
Goodnight...

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:53.000
[Percussive Acoustic Guitar Outro]
